"title": "巴拉迦",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "巴拉迦",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>巴拉迦</h1><p>巴拉迦是以利戶的父親，並被描述為布西人（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Job32:2,Job32:6\">伯32:2</a>、<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Job32:2,Job32:6\">6</a>；參<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen22:21\">創22:21</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Jer25:23\">耶25:23</a>）。在約伯的三位年長的朋友勸說未果之後，以利戶曾試圖勸導約伯。</p>",
